{"id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pseudobool.md","title":"Pseudo-Boolean function","display":"df-pseudobool — Pseudo-Boolean function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pseudobool","aliases":["27-df-pseudobool"],"display":"df-pseudobool — Pseudo-Boolean function","depends_on":["[[27-df-vardom]]","[[27-df-real]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.12.2; §13.1","source_statement":"Pseudo-Boolean function","source_printed_pages":"45; 564","source_pdf_pages":"69; 588","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pseudobool"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pseudobool</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pseudobool — Pseudo-Boolean function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dcab93ecb7af658c\" href=\"?note=dcab93ecb7af658c\" title=\"27-df-real\">27-df-real</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.12.2; §13.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"Pseudo-Boolean function\">Pseudo-Boolean function</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"45; 564"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"69; 588"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^n=\\{0,1\\}^{\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}}\">\\(\\mathbb B^n=\\{0,1\\}^{\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dcab93ecb7af658c\" href=\"?note=dcab93ecb7af658c\" title=\"27-df-real\">27-df-real</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\mid f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\mid f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书将 Boolean 取值嵌入实数后得到此函数类。值域为实数；它不同于只取 0、1 的 Boolean function。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vardom]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-real","status":"resolved","id":"dcab93ecb7af658c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"Pseudo-Boolean function","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Pseudo-Boolean function]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $\\mathbb B^n=\\{0,1\\}^{\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}}$（see [[27-df-vardom]]），$\\mathbb R$（see [[27-df-real]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-real","status":"resolved","id":"dcab93ecb7af658c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $\\mathbb B^n=\\{0,1\\}^{\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}}$（see [[27-df-vardom]]），$\\mathbb R$（see [[27-df-real]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^n=\\{0,1\\}^{\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\mid f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1161,"backlinks":[{"id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。"},{"id":"3020cb523ec5a332","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]），$i\\in N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$b\\in\\mathbb B$，$x\\in\\mathbb B^n$。"},{"id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]）；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。"},{"id":"04d7134ec7c768b5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（[[27-df-pseudobool]]），$N=[n]$；空积为1。"},{"id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]）。空积取 1，空和取 0。"},{"id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]）。"},{"id":"38ea9b4ad6eccc66","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（[[27-df-pseudobool]]）为单射；水平参数为标量$r\\in\\mathbb R$。"},{"id":"a80118b233c9c7df","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（[[27-df-pseudobool]]）；单射限制在下面两个类谓词中显式给出。对$S\\subseteq[n]$，$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^S$；空坐标积允许。"},{"id":"9c7a7ba711a14913","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]），$x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n$。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-308","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pseudobool|df-pseudobool — Pseudo-Boolean function]]"},{"id":"084c52a515723288","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$c,d:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R$。$\\mathbb B^n$ 和实数值函数空间（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]）。空积取 1。"},{"id":"a2fa942a71444f31","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（见 [[27-df-pseudobool]]）满足 $\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^m c_k\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i)$。$\\iota:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B\\to\\mathbb B^{n+1}$ 与 $g:\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb R$ 由下式定义；空积为 1。"}],"outgoing":["4b84ee77aaf0c828","dcab93ecb7af658c"]}